      "extract": "In this section, we give some details of the one-parameter interpolating family of Skyrme systems. The field is denoted $\\Phi_{\\beta}=(\\Phi_1,\\Phi_2,\\Phi_3,\\Phi_4)$, where each component $\\Phi_{\\beta}$ is a function of the spatial coordinates $x^j=(x^1,x^2,x^3)=(x,y,z)$, and the constraint $\\Phi_{\\beta}\\Phi_{\\beta}=1$ is imposed. The energy density for the system, parametrized by $\\alpha\\in[0,1]$, is $$\\label{Enden}",
