      "extract": "In this section, we investigate various triply-periodic solutions in the family of generalized Skyrme systems para- metrized by $\\alpha$. There are many of these, corresponding to different local minima of the energy, and we shall describe only some of them. The results that follow are obtained by numerical minimization of the energy functional $E[\\Phi]$. More specifically, the expression for the energy is replaced",
