      ],
      "extract": "We have studied triply-periodic stable solutions (local minima of the energy) in a family of Skyrme-type systems parametrized by $\\alpha\\in[0,1]$, which interpolates between the standard Skyrme model (at $\\alpha=0$) and the Skyrme-Faddeev system (at $\\alpha=1$). At $\\alpha=0$, the lowest-energy crystal resembles a cubic lattice of half-skyrmion particles, and this picture persists near $\\alpha=0$, as one would",
